### 2.2 Smooth Scrolling & Scrollytelling Mechanics (`Lenis` + `GSAP ScrollTrigger`)
- **Smooth Scroll Provider (`frontend/src/components/motion/SmoothScrollProvider.tsx`):**
  - Initialize `Lenis` (`duration: 1.15`, `easing: (t) => Math.min(1, 1.001 - Math.pow(2, -10 * t))`, `smoothWheel: true`).
  - Synchronize Lenis with `gsap.ticker`:
    ```ts
    lenis.on('scroll', ScrollTrigger.update);
    gsap.ticker.add((time) => lenis.raf(time * 1000));
    gsap.ticker.lagSmoothing(0);
    ```
  - Respect `window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)')`: if enabled, bypass Lenis and disable camera spline scrubbing.
- **Word-by-Word Blur Reveal Headline (`frontend/src/components/motion/BlurRevealHeadline.tsx`):**
  - Splits headline text into `<span className="inline-block will-change-transform">` words.
  - Animates each word from `{ opacity: 0, filter: 'blur(12px)', y: 24 }` to `{ opacity: 1, filter: 'blur(0px)', y: 0 }` using `stagger: 0.045`, `duration: 0.75`, `ease: 'power3.out'`.
- **Pinned Scroll-Scrubbed Story Intro (`frontend/src/components/layout/ScrollyHeroSection.tsx`):**
  - Outer container has `height: 260vh`; inner viewport has `position: sticky; top: 0; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden`.
