### 4.3 REST & SSE API Endpoints (`backend/app/main.py`)
- `POST /api/v1/auth/register` -> Creates user in SQLite, returns `{ access_token, user }`.
- `POST /api/v1/auth/login` -> Authenticates email/password against SQLite, returns `{ access_token, user }`.
- `POST /api/v1/auth/demo-login` -> Instant 1-click login as `Judge Demo Evaluator` (`demo@patchpath.ai`), returning a valid token so judges never get stuck on a form.
- `GET /api/v1/auth/me` -> Returns current authenticated user profile.
- `GET /api/v1/demos/{mode}` -> Returns the pre-seeded `ProjectAnalysisRun` (`cs_repo`, `ece_circuit`, or `civil_mech`) from SQLite.
- `POST /api/v1/simulate/{run_id}` -> Runs the 5-step sandbox verification for `plan_a`, `plan_b`, and `plan_c`, logs every step to `sandbox_execution_logs` in SQLite, and returns the updated run.
- `GET /api/v1/stream/{run_id}` -> **Server-Sent Events (SSE)** endpoint that streams step-by-step events (`STEP_1_SCAN`, `STEP_2_GENERATE`, `STEP_3_TEST`, `STEP_4_CLASSIFY`, `STEP_5_RECOMMEND`) with `350ms` pacing for live UI + 3D animation choreography.
- `POST /api/v1/upskiller/analyze` -> Accepts `{ title, raw_input, department_lens }`, runs `upskiller_engine.py` + `cs_repo_engine.py` (if repo/package.json detected), stores the new `ProjectAnalysisRun` in SQLite, and returns the full upskilled blueprint + 3D `SystemGraph`.
- `GET /api/v1/runs` -> Lists all saved analysis & upskiller runs from SQLite for the History Drawer.

